summary: 'Shipped the Paradigm Brain MVP (TD-2026-09-29-204): structure for any folder of personal documents, for non-developers. Out-of-tree index (never writes into the user''s folder), md/txt only, local detectors (secrets, cards, SSN, MRZ, IBAN, JWT, cloud keys) before persistence, default-deny gates with one view choke point, egress log + purge, deterministic suggest→confirm, provable brain→code staleness via workspaces, on-demand paradigm_brain MCP family (metadata-only, enveloped), `paradigm brain` CLI and a plain-language Platform Brain section. Two Aegis passes: fixed a quadratic ReDoS (2MB line ~28min → 10ms), case/Unicode hard-block bypass, symlink TOCTOU, cross-origin localhost reads (exact-origin + HttpOnly owner cookie), incomplete injection envelope, and added brain.yaml tamper detection with race-safe saves and diff-before-acknowledge. Browser-verified: locked zones show counts only, gated content unsearchable, Keep writes declared.yaml out of tree.'
